    <DataNode elementId="L-DOPACHROME" textLabel="L-dopachrome" type="Metabolite">
      <Xref identifier="VJNCICVKUHKIIV-LURJTMIESA-M" dataSource="InChIKey" />
      <Graphics centerX="350" centerY="600" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="3955e7" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="3955e7" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="PMN, zhang">The precursor of |FRAME: L-DOPACHROME|, |FRAME: CPD-8652|, is very easily autoxidized, resulting in accumulation of |FRAME: L-DOPACHROME| during the the early phase of eumelanogenesis. Dopachrome is fairly stable, with a half-life of about 30 min, but also decomposes spontaneously, giving mostly |FRAME: DIHYDROXYINDOLE|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="L-DOPACHROME" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Zinc" value="ZINC000030724207" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Seed" value="cpd01169" />
